# Design & UI Conventions

## Brand
- **Monzo palette**: Primary coral (#FE4B60), navy (#001E3A), teal (#007A8B), green (#4BB78F)
- **Font**: Plus Jakarta Sans
- **Tone**: Calm, financial tool, mobile-first, motion-enhanced

## Motion stack
- **Motion** (`motion/react`) for page/section transitions and springs
- **Animate UI–style** pieces under `src/components/animate-ui/` (e.g. SlidingNumber)
- **Magic UI–style** accents under `src/components/magicui/` (e.g. BorderBeam)
- **React Bits–style** atmosphere under `src/components/react-bits/` (e.g. AuroraBackground)
- Always respect `prefers-reduced-motion` / `useReducedMotion()`
- Prefer 2–3 intentional motions per viewport (entrance, hover, value change)

## Layout
- Shared chrome via `SiteShell`
- Mobile-first, one-hand usable
- Max content width: max-w-lg (512px) for calculator card
- Consistent spacing: p-4 sm:p-6 for cards

## Components
- Use shadcn-style components from `@/components/ui/*`
- Primary actions: coral background (variant="default")
- Secondary: outline or ghost
- All interactive elements must have aria-labels

## Accessibility
- No essential info by color only
- Keyboard navigable
- High contrast (foreground/background)
